## Root Cause Analysis

**Port Configuration Mismatch:**
The dashboard health API was hardcoded with incorrect ports for notification (3003 vs 4003) and monitoring (3004 vs 4004) services, causing all health checks for these services to fail silently.

**Dashboard Data Loading Race Conditions:**
The overview page had multiple useEffect hooks without proper cleanup, causing state updates after component unmount and potential memory leaks. Fixed by adding cancelled flags and proper cleanup functions.

**TypeScript Strict Mode Violations:**
Used Array<T> syntax which is forbidden by ESLint rules. Required conversion to T[] for consistency.

